### FisioNat Microservice (REST Client)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Accept: application/json

### Solicitud de contacto (bienvenida + notificación)
POST {{baseUrl}}/mail/welcome
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "lastName": "",
  "email": "",
  "cellphone": "",
  "subject": "",
  "message": ""
}

